WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.011
My case.

00:00:01.011 --> 00:00:06.500
A veteran reported foreign interference targeting the mental health infrastructure that serves soldiers.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.795
The response was not investigation.

00:00:08.795 --> 00:00:10.215
It was prosecution.

00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:13.136
The message: stay silent or be destroyed.
